/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 82 0 R
/E (Existing solutions include Cisco's Smart+Connected Communities, Siemens City Performance Tool, and Microsoft CityNext. IEEE 2413-2019 defines IoT architecture standards. ETSI standards govern M2M communications. AI-based traffic tools \(e.g., Google DeepMind\) and waste IoT sensors are commercially deployed.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
