/P 82 0 R
/E (Gaps & Limitations)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
113 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 82 0 R
/E (Current systems lack interoperability across vendors. Most deployments are siloed, addressing single domains only. Data privacy frameworks \(GDPR\) create compliance challenges. High infrastructure costs limit adoption in developing cities. Real-time multi-domain optimisation remains an open research problem.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
