/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 82 0 R
/E (Several studies examine smart city frameworks. Batty et al. \(2012\) outline urban data systems. Albino et al. \(2015\) review smart city definitions and dimensions. IBM Smarter Cities reports highlight IoT-driven governance. UN-Habitat \(2020\) standards address inclusive urban planning and SDG 11 compliance.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
